{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1dc58ed883255430d9938234c572cd1f80bda241f27223649b82eb3906e829f4", "ja": "（『SHADE OF SPADE』の演劇公演のため、\nレッスンが進んでいる。今から様子を見に……あれ？）", "zh": "（为了《SHADE OF SPADE》的演剧公演，课程正在进行中。现在就去看看情况……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6e6d45eb5b4264e9bca9a14a12162906af72f87905054caa889ce0e5ba7e8c5b", "ja": "うーん……むむむ……むーっ。", "zh": "嗯……唔唔唔……唔——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d13ba768223964f338096fb020201b2c6fdd4072a09054af489bebb22bb623c8", "ja": "歩、どうしたんだ？\n今はレッスン中じゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "步，怎么了？\n现在不是正在上训练课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b069e6e908418e1e347eda039578794ccaf98a86ae9cb74cc6d13dead506eddb", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！　そうなんだけどさ～、\nちょっと……ひとりで演技を見直してたんだ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！是这样没错啦～\n只是……我刚才一个人在重新检查演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1004_p", "source_sha256": "657c63ecef0c74c575731437fe9f155873a5c6bf1bff072d118948b9f488d474", "ja": "ひとりで？　何か悩んでるとか？", "zh": "一个人？是有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e929140252a83bb4aa8c5fef3ebe248cb884a54722de5ac8ec27a082d804f424", "ja": "うぅ……実は、ちょっとだけ。\nなんか、演技が物足りないかもって思っちゃって。", "zh": "唔……其实，就一点点啦。\n总觉得，自己的演技好像还不够到位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2093cf8e4c5d57d26102b32d69dbafbd493816d8720252711b0cf255b7296072", "ja": "今回の役って、ダークでクールで知的な感じで、\nアタシとは全然違うじゃん？", "zh": "这次的角色是那种黑暗、冷酷又知性的感觉，和我完全不一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b27f4b2d5c8a90120708856c9780ded420e6217143c2de9f4ba65b9fb7d23e17", "ja": "どうやったら、もっとそれっぽく演じられるかなって。\nちゃんとできてる気がしなくてさ……うーん……。", "zh": "我在想，怎样才能演得更像一点。\n总觉得自己好像还没演好……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1008_p", "source_sha256": "eaa09b3bbbfe6e94b4d8da498af09d3305b15b7412cfccb8750b3464a85afbab", "ja": "え？　いや、うーん……。\nなあ歩、今ちょっとやってみてもらえないか？", "zh": "诶？不，嗯……  \n那个，步，现在能不能稍微演一下给我看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dac028fe6017f1de4da7882df4d4364624b17a463ed92dc03d82a6a4a69450c9", "ja": "やるって……役の演技をここで！？　ええ……。\n急に言われると緊張するなぁ……コホン。", "zh": "来一段是指……在这里演一下角色吗！？诶诶……\n突然这么一说好紧张啊……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "194b1f77170ba2acc6a44f0c81b6917118c4e50533d0c7e32a2c52a6399716f9", "ja": "「資料を見たでしょう、スタークス。彼らの名前も、\nアンジーの手帳にあった。意味はわかりますね？」", "zh": "「你看过资料了吧，斯塔克斯。他们的名字，\n也出现在了安吉的手账上。你明白这意味着什么吧？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8b190d8745377ed726029ef5918f47f757ad117b3b87d33a08eda6e09f4de5b1", "ja": "や、やったよ！　どうかな……？", "zh": "成、成功了！感觉怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_1012", "source_sha256": "60e77c83ff620c4bf848572a450255c1e1032f5071436889c79427704253496a", "ja": "カンペキ！", "zh": "完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d1876ada99677fb97774c20a93161e32642e9b2eafa1a1a99d3d646bac589619", "ja": "うん、できてるよ、カンペキだ！\n何度かリハで見せてもらってるけど。言う事なし。", "zh": "嗯，做得很好，完美！\n虽然彩排时已经看过好几次了，但真是无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "677b5c8c10a843edf5faca3e6b22f727507c242daad305ab33c3a3b868ef247b", "ja": "えっ、ウソだ～！\nアタシ、特別なこと何もしてないよ？", "zh": "诶，骗人的吧～！\n我什么特别的事都没做啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1abb6890c50e54bf9a37c136ed72893fc88da0a369ac89b786b59ec02cf54aca", "ja": "自然にできちゃってると、わからないのかもな。\n本当、カンペキにできてるよ。", "zh": "可能正因为能自然而然地做到，自己才意识不到吧。真的，你做得无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2003_p", "source_sha256": "06f7ec6a782f33fef9614b8cc7d77a9cba344de1fd52435edb0251abc121efc7", "ja": "ハーマンの魅力って、ミステリアスさだと思うんだ。\nだから、迷いながらやるくらいがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我觉得，哈曼的魅力就在于神秘感。\n所以，带着些许迷茫去做，或许会更好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "10b03588e4e595d4f4a9b845aee605314d44ab2ef4ccdc9a5d5a76cc408323e8", "ja": "そっか……うん、なんか自信ついてきたかも！\nホント、アタシを乗せるのうまいよね！？　へへっ♪", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，感觉我好像越来越有自信了！\n你真的很会哄我开心呢！？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f3b755f66ff67f18d73d4cba401401c4340f65a16025aa99072087f61aeb8759", "ja": "あ……でも待って！　そうすると、自信がついたら\nダメって事？　どうしたら……オーマイガーッ！？", "zh": "啊……等等！这么说的话，自信起来反而不行吗？该怎么办……我的天啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0323_2006_p", "source_sha256": "1e52a122d4545d7d2638e0e351bdc62247476dd74021c5b15d9d6cb5a4977b5e", "ja": "（悩みは尽きないみたいだ……。\nまあ、きっと大丈夫だ！　信じてるからな、歩！）", "zh": "（她好像总有烦恼不完的事……。不过，肯定没问题！因为我相信你啊，步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
